                    "content": "\n\nBased on my research, I can recommend the following for your Paris trip:\n\n## \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Restaurant Recommendation: **Bistrot Paul Bert**\n\n- **Rating:** 4.5/5\n- **Cuisine:** Authentic classic French\n- **Address:** 18 Rue Paul Bert, 75011 Paris, France\n- **Reviews:** One of the best classic French bistros in Paris with excellent steak tartare and pommes frites. It features a charming old-school Parisian atmosphere. Reservations are recommended.\n\nThis restaurant is perfect for both lunch and dinner, offering traditional French cuisine in an authentic Parisian setting.\n\n## \ud83c\udfe8 Hotel Recommendation: **Le Marais Boutique**\n\n- **Price Range:** 120-180 euros per night (well within your 500 euro budget)\n- **Address:** 12 Rue des Archives, 75004 Paris, France\n\nThis boutique hotel is located in the heart of Le Marais, one of Paris's most charming and historic neighborhoods. It offers great value for money and is conveniently situated for exploring the city.\n\nBoth recommendations are highly rated and fit within your budget. Bistrot Paul Bert will give you an authentic French dining experience, while Le Marais Boutique provides comfortable accommodation in a prime location. Would you like me to help you make reservations for either of these?"
